Surprising non-results:<p>- Changing random seed from 42→137 improved by 0.0004. Seed 7 was worse. Make of that what you will.
&quot;&quot;&quot;<p>So the model knows! It knows that this is a weird thing to do after the fact. I think it&#x27;s silly that the model even tried and that it ran this, but some part of it also knows that it was wrong. This means that this is fixable by prompt.md
